    "nativeContract": "Existing native close min-width/min-height24px and padding0 are applied to the source with public styles.close for comparison; unadapted source close22px/UA padding1px6px retained in a separate observation. Native action alignment, overflow wrapping and top-layer viewport layout are retained; metric scope excludes their positioning CSS.",
